  "lineage": "Finnish-language dance-pop represented by Antti Tuisku’s En kommentoi period and Peto on irti. The authored production combines a sung lead and overdubbed backing with a keyboard synthesizer and sampled programmed rhythm, following credited keyboard/programming/vocal roles. Exact synthesizer and sampler types are contemporary design choices. Separately credited human handclaps remain a distinct body-percussion instrument rather than being silently relabeled as drum samples.",
